## COMMUNICATION
The FLP anchored MOF that features activation groups including open metal sites and hydroxyl groups has been synthesized, and it can serve as a highly efficient heterogeneous catalyst to selectively reduce the imine bond in a \(\upbeta\)-unsaturated imine substrates to afford unsaturated amine compounds by directly using hydrogen gas under moderate pressure.
